  'Read': 'Li', 'John 15:12 (KJV)': 'Jan 15:12',
  'Jesus does not leave love undefined. He gives it a measure:': 'Jezi pa kite lanmou san definisyon. Li ba l yon mezi:',
  'as I have loved you': 'menm jan mwen te renmen nou an',
  '. That measure moves love out of feelings alone and into covenant. It becomes patient, costly, forgiving and faithful.': '. Mezi sa a fè lanmou soti nan santiman sèlman pou l antre nan alyans. Li vin pasyan, li koute, li padone e li fidèl.',
  'In counseling we often see couples who love each other sincerely but have no shared blueprint. Each partner builds from their own family’s plans, their own wounds and their own expectations. Christ offers a better blueprint. It is one we learn together and practise daily. It turns small, repeated choices into a house that stands.': 'Nan konsèy, nou souvan wè koup ki renmen youn lòt sensèman men ki pa gen yon plan ansanm. Chak moun ap bati ak plan fanmi pa l, blesi pa l ak atant pa l. Kris ofri yon pi bon plan. Se yon plan nou aprann ansanm epi pratike chak jou. Li fè ti chwa nou repete yo tounen yon kay ki kanpe fèm.',
  'Reflect': 'Reflechi',
