  'Everything in Covenant': 'Tout sa ki nan Alyans', 'Up to 4 family profiles': 'Jiska 4 pwofil fanmi', 'Parenting & family tracks': 'Pakou pou paran ak fanmi', 'Quarterly family check-in': 'Bilan fanmi chak twa mwa', 'Choose Family': 'Chwazi Fanmi',
  'Questions': 'Kesyon', 'Frequently <em>asked</em>.': 'Kesyon moun <em>poze souvan</em>.',
  'Is counseling confidential?': 'Èske konsèy la konfidansyèl?',
  'Yes. Your intake and sessions are shared only with your assigned counselor. The only exceptions are situations where someone’s safety is at risk, and we explain these limits clearly at your first session.': 'Wi. Enfòmasyon w ak seyans ou yo se sèlman konseye ki okipe w la ki konnen yo. Sèl eksepsyon yo se lè sekirite yon moun an danje, epi n ap eksplike limit sa yo klè depi premye seyans lan.',
  'Do I need to be a Christian to receive care?': 'Èske m bezwen kretyen pou m resevwa swen?',
  'No. Our care is openly Christ-centered, and everyone seeking guidance is welcome. We never pressure you. We invite you.': 'Non. Swen nou klèman santre sou Kris, epi tout moun k ap chèche konsèy byenvini. Nou pa janm fòse w. Nou envite w.',
  'Are sessions online or in person?': 'Èske seyans yo fèt sou entènèt oswa fasafas?',
  'Both. You can meet by secure video from anywhere, or in person in Fort-Liberté, Haïti.': 'Tou de. Ou ka rankontre nou pa videyo sekirize kèlkeswa kote w ye, oswa fasafas Fò Libète, Ayiti.',
  'What happens if I cancel my membership?': 'Kisa k ap pase si m anile abònman m?',
  'You keep access until the end of your current billing period. Your account then moves to the free Pilgrim level, and your progress is preserved.': 'W ap kenbe aksè a jiska fen peryòd ou te peye a. Apre sa, kont ou pase nan nivo Pèlren gratis la, epi pwogrè w rete.',
  'Do you offer multi-user family plans?': 'Èske nou gen plan pou plizyè moun nan yon fanmi?',
  'Yes. The Covenant Family tier is built for households and gives up to four family members their own profile and journey.': 'Wi. Plan Alyans Fanmi an fèt pou fanmi epi li bay jiska kat moun nan fanmi an pwòp pwofil yo ak pwòp pakou yo.',

